                      P(c_1, \cdots, c_n; c) \otimes P(d_{1,1}, \cdots, d_{1,k_1}; c_1)
                      \\otimes \cdots \otimes P(d_{n,1}, \cdots, d_{n,k_n}; c_n)
                      \\to
                      P(d_{1,1}, \cdots, d_{n,k_n}, c)
